# Agent working rules — LOCAL ONLY. Swept into the repo by an unrelated commit
# (c4207b9e, a map-colour feature) on 2026-07-03 and public for five weeks before
# anyone chose to publish it. Still read by Claude Code from disk; just not shipped.
/CLAUDE.md

# Claude Code settings, and the campaign working notes — LOCAL ONLY.
#
# 214 files (10.2 MB) were force-added here during the audit campaign and untracked on
# 2026-08-09: probe/proof scripts, frozen audit JSON, before/after run logs, intermediate
# ledger state. They are working artifacts of a closed campaign, they are still on disk,
# and this repo is PUBLIC — the baseline run logs in particular carried household room
# names. Nothing referenced them: the closeout has zero markdown hyperlinks to its siblings.
#
# No exceptions: the one publicly-linked artifact, the AUDIT-1 closeout, moved to
# docs/audit-1-closeout.md where published things live. Nothing under here is tracked.
.claude/

# Docker cold-install harness — persistent HA config from docker-compose.yml.
# Wipe the folder to test a fresh-from-zero install.
.test-config/
